  "description": "CellHasWater: any corner with depth > 0; CellHasLand: any corner with depth <= 0; a NaN depth is neither. Depths (-1, -1, -1, 0.5): both true (a shore cell). (0, 0, 0, 0): water false, land true. NaN with the rest -1: water false, land true. All NaN: both false. A cell out of bounds: both false.",
